==History==
2023
*The Archers' Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/11/2023)|November 2023 Update]] on 6/11/2023 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 13/12/2023, the [[Version History#Tower Troop Update (13/12/2023)|Tower Troop Update]] decreased the Evolved Archers' Power Shot damage to 170% of their damage (from 200%) {{Balance|Nerf}}. The update also changed their description. Before, it used to read: ''These Archers have been specifically trained by Archer Queen herself as her personal sharpshooters. They deal double Damage to far away enemies with Power Shot! {{Balance|Neutral}}''.
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]] decreased the Evolved Archers' range to 6 tiles (from 6.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}} and decreased their minimum Power Shot range to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]] increased the Evolved Archers' Power Shot damage to 200% of their damage (from 170%) {{Balance|Buff}}, but removed their hitpoints boost {{Balance|Remove}}.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]] added a sound effect to the Evolved Archers after death {{Balance|Add}}.
2025
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Evolved Archers' damage by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased their minimum Power Shot range to 4 tiles (from 4.5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}} and decreased the Power Shot damage to 150% (from 200%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026
